$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag\n<f1>Planet: <f0> UberPrime\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Just right for a fight!\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Twilight\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Long ago, the tribes of the Blood Eagle and Diamond Sword built a grand vault to hold their treasures.  When the tribes were pitted against one another the vault was forgotten....Now the tribes have located the lost vault and their once shared village, now they must head toward the sun and fight to find the Hidden Treasure.  Map by Mooch{FK}.";
